---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConceptNav from '../../../components/ConceptNav.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="zh" title="可编排研发流程 — OpenLogos" description="OpenLogos 全自动化背后的声明式研发流程引擎、两档授权与 loop-exhausted 硬红线。">
  <ConceptNav current="orchestratable-flow" lang="zh" />
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-tag tag-amber">核心理念</div>
      <h1>可编排研发流程</h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">整个变更生命周期是一台声明式状态机。一次授权——<code>openlogos next --auto</code>——AI driver 便从头跑到尾，只在硬安全线前停下。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="flow-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="flow">
        <div class="flow-card flow-why">
          <div class="flow-phase">引擎</div>
          <div class="flow-tag tag-amber">状态机</div>
          <h2>是一台可派生的 flow，而非一段脚本</h2>
          <p>引擎把整个变更生命周期建模为 <code>subflow → node → gate → loop</code>，作为唯一事实源：<code>status</code>、<code>next</code>、<code>watch</code> 都从模板<strong>被动派生</strong>当前前沿——引擎不自持任何状态。项目 overlay 可 <code>extends: builtin:launched</code>，只写差异。</p>
          <div class="flow-steps">
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">1</span> <code>plan</code> — 变更提案</div>
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">2</span> <code>spec</code> — 规格 delta</div>
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">3</span> <code>merge</code> — 把 delta 合并进主文档</div>
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">4</span> <code>slice</code> — 规划 <code>[code]</code> 切片</div>
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">5</span> <code>implement</code> — 切片循环 ↻</div>
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">6</span> <code>deliver</code> — verify / 部署 / smoke</div>
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">7</span> <code>close</code> — 归档与 push</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-gate">openlogos flow show --resolved 渲染应用 overlay 后的真实编排</div>
        </div>

        <div class="flow-arrow">
          <svg width="32" height="48" viewBox="0 0 32 48"><path d="M16 0v40m-8-8l8 8 8-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          <span>每段都经由一道门退出</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flow-card flow-what">
          <div class="flow-phase">授权</div>
          <div class="flow-tag tag-blue">门 · GATE</div>
          <h2>两档：人类确认点 vs standing 授权</h2>
          <p>每个 subflow 经由一道<em>门</em>退出（<code>type: human</code> 或 <code>none</code>，带 <code>skippable: true|false</code>）。门的行为取决于本次运行选的档位。</p>
          <div class="flow-outputs">
            <h4>行为</h4>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>半自动（默认）</strong>——merge、verify、部署、smoke、archive、push 保持人类确认点。</li>
              <li><strong>全自动（<code>--auto</code>）</strong>——对整条链路的一次性、run-scoped standing 授权。</li>
              <li>自动放行 <code>skippable</code> 门；代码转绿后自动执行 verify / smoke / archive / push。</li>
              <li>每次自动放行向 <code>GATE_AUTO_PASSED</code> 追加一行审计（是审计，非状态源）。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-gate">半自动是默认。全自动需显式开启，一次授权覆盖本次运行。</div>
        </div>

        <div class="flow-arrow">
          <svg width="32" height="48" viewBox="0 0 32 48"><path d="M16 0v40m-8-8l8 8 8-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          <span>自动化永远跳不过的那道门</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flow-card flow-how">
          <div class="flow-phase">安全底座</div>
          <div class="flow-tag tag-green">硬红线</div>
          <h2>implement 循环绝不发布未过测试的代码</h2>
          <p>merge 之后，<code>slice-planner</code> 把已合并规格拆成良构的 <code>[code]</code> 切片。implement 段随后循环，直到客观收敛信号满足。</p>
          <div class="flow-steps">
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">↻</span> 循环直到 <code>code_slices_green</code>（切片全勾 ∧ 末轮测试绿）</div>
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">30</span> 循环有迭代上限（<code>max_iters</code>）</div>
            <div class="step-item"><span class="step-num">!</span> 达上限仍未收敛 → 升级为不可跳过的 <code>loop-exhausted</code> 门</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-gate">任何模式——即便 --auto——都绝不自动放行未通过测试的代码</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="insight-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="insight-grid">
        <div class="insight-card">
          <h3>全自动不危险吗？</h3>
          <p>安全底座是<strong>硬红线</strong>：<code>loop-exhausted</code> 门在任何模式下都不可跳过，所以全自动绝不放行测试未过的代码。除此之外，<code>--auto</code> 只自动放行你显式标注为 <code>skippable</code> 的门，且每次放行都记入 append-only 的 <code>GATE_AUTO_PASSED</code> 审计轨迹。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-card">
          <h3>这和 CI 流水线有何不同？</h3>
          <p>CI 在你<em>写完代码之后</em>才跑。flow 编排的是<strong>整个变更</strong>——提案、规格 delta、切片、实现、验证、交付——作为一台可派生的状态机。因为状态是派生而非存储的，<code>status</code> / <code>next</code> / <code>watch</code> 永远对「下一个动作」达成一致，AI driver 可无人值守地执行。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>在你的项目里看 flow</h2>
      <p>运行 <code>openlogos flow show --resolved</code> 渲染编排，或 <code>openlogos watch</code> 流式查看实时状态。</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/zh/cli/flow-show" class="btn btn-primary">flow show</a>
        <a href="/zh/specs/flow-spec" class="btn btn-ghost">下一篇：Flow 规格 →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }

  .page-hero { padding: 5rem 1.5rem 3rem; text-align: center; }
  .hero-tag { display: inline-block; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .tag-amber { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #f59e0b; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25); }
  .tag-blue { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12); color: #3b82f6; border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25); }
  .tag-green { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); color: #10b981; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25); }
  .page-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .page-hero code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85em; background: var(--color-surface); padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .hero-desc { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .flow-section { padding: 2rem 0 4rem; }
  .flow { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0; }

  .flow-card {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s;
  }
  .flow-why:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06); }
  .flow-what:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.06); }
  .flow-how:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.06); }

  .flow-phase { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .flow-tag { display: inline-block; padding: 0.2rem 0.625rem; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .flow-card h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.625rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .flow-card > p { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  .flow-outputs h4, .flow-steps h4 { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .flow-outputs ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .flow-outputs li { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); padding-left: 1.25rem; position: relative; }
  .flow-outputs li::before { content: '→'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); }

  .flow-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .step-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .step-num { flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--color-surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .step-item code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; background: var(--color-surface-raised); padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem; border-radius: 4px; }

  .flow-gate { margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: var(--color-surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-weight: 500; }

  .flow-arrow { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); opacity: 0.4; padding: 0.5rem 0; }
  .flow-arrow span { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

  .insight-section { padding: 4rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .insight-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .insight-card { background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 2rem; }
  .insight-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .insight-card p { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .insight-card strong { color: var(--color-text-secondary); }

  .cta-section { padding: 4rem 0 6rem; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .cta-section h2 { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .cta-section > .container > p { color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .cta-section code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85rem; background: var(--color-surface); padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-sans); transition: all 0.2s; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--color-primary); color: white; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--color-primary-hover); color: white; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-ghost { background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-text); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--color-border-hover); color: var(--color-text); transform: translateY(-1px); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2rem; }
    .insight-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
